CORE
test.c
--nondet-volatile-write-model reg:observe --mmio-weak --mmio-weak-depth 2
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
device observed the write of 1: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
Without write combining, both writes to reg are observed in program order (at
the latest by the barrier), so the device observes the value 1 and the assertion
holds. Compare test.desc, where --mmio-gather allows the first write to be
combined away.
